    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="4e08c4d6-ec48-5b38-9b1e-d8ad0ae8d99c" activityNameId="ff3580f5-87e0-5a0e-89dd-f0b91418ef84" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Benzyl chloride, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Benzyl chloride, at plant
The process "benzyl chloride, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of benzyl chloride  from toluene in Europe. Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation.  Energy consumptions are modelled with literature data. The emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000100-44-7; 
Formula: C7H7Cl; 
UUID: 1f862f9a-0b0c-3c2f-8969-0c3f4e9a8e25
Production of benzyl chloride including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Chlorination of toluene
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports are modelled with standard distances.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1f862f9a-0b0c-3c2f-8969-0c3f4e9a8e25.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
